          <td class="p-3.5 text-red-700 font-bold">$28 - $38 (or Rs. 6,000 - 8,500)</td>
          <td class="p-3.5 text-emerald-700 font-bold">$3 - $5 (or Rs. 1,200 - 1,800)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
